{"id": "clm:ae5246adbb02d5a85ed449cd0d9708ba747e6cec278b4680a579cab412e34c44", "type": "statement", "text": "VisuaLeaf reports that a matching aggregation failed with 'operation exceeded time limit' under a stored 1 ms budget, without command maxTimeMS, and succeeded after removing that setting; the test used MongoDB 9.0.2 and FCV 9.0. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-09)", "source_url": "https://visualeaf.com/blog/mongodb-9-0-whats-new/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Per-shape maxTimeMS and queryKnobs (9.0)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:3306142c7e1e2c7b3864a59c5f7c4f8445b0faf02260cd878c0038fab886bf41", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:616d8217d3e7244e75158ff3a6714eea789383c5be749620d75ae67e5cbfacc1", "ev:993ed6fa6904fd4844054e721531ef4c1279a963c8e08a8a9c4e9abfd2421e7d"]}
{"id": "clm:cc5763ede5ddd9e2799cbdc56b63d9e08da0e703102dca4cfee3320e500a4165", "type": "statement", "text": "Choose a shape budget using realistic parameter values: structurally matching queries can perform very different amounts of work, and a timeout stops excess work rather than accelerating execution. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-09)", "source_url": "https://visualeaf.com/blog/mongodb-9-0-whats-new/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Per-shape maxTimeMS and queryKnobs (9.0)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:3306142c7e1e2c7b3864a59c5f7c4f8445b0faf02260cd878c0038fab886bf41", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:616d8217d3e7244e75158ff3a6714eea789383c5be749620d75ae67e5cbfacc1"]}
{"id": "clm:8188420f5462342e52b2d8cddccd61eae51c1b4f41d42e72dcb6e0f4869b3abd", "type": "statement", "text": "MongoDB 9.0 introduces per-shape maxTimeMS and queryKnobs through setQuerySettings; both require FCV 9.0 or later. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-26)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/release-notes/9.0.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Per-shape maxTimeMS and queryKnobs (9.0)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.nosqlbooster.com/blog/announcing-nosqlbooster-11-2/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:3306142c7e1e2c7b3864a59c5f7c4f8445b0faf02260cd878c0038fab886bf41", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:ad280167e23a7981d4b8e2c48a1bfc20c84d82cde8dbdb5ebfcaf54a47ddc64a", "ev:dcb994055f0b83aae69fa6b96e5b53ce05f678121b36b20ad62ac1a5f4a20bd1"]}
{"id": "clm:01b91276260df571a657f74d1b5af24482e1ac5f01e51151e2e312b314e7edb3", "type": "statement", "text": "A stored maxTimeMS takes precedence over command-level maxTimeMS, so it can tighten or loosen that server-side execution budget. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Per-shape maxTimeMS and queryKnobs (9.0)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://visualeaf.com/blog/mongodb-9-0-whats-new/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:3306142c7e1e2c7b3864a59c5f7c4f8445b0faf02260cd878c0038fab886bf41", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:9726f24e30b06788de00dfb98057c0635a762527965257ed6ca6f695ffb13960"]}
{"id": "clm:76e3f616654eb2e000c19914af5a50c103d5a76a0db122e2a92ca74b9f90016c", "type": "statement", "text": "Setting per-shape maxTimeMS to 0 clears the override; command-level maxTimeMS and defaultMaxTimeMS then govern timeout selection. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Per-shape maxTimeMS and queryKnobs (9.0)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:3306142c7e1e2c7b3864a59c5f7c4f8445b0faf02260cd878c0038fab886bf41", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:9726f24e30b06788de00dfb98057c0635a762527965257ed6ca6f695ffb13960"]}
{"id": "clm:62dc07cf07667f7ed4bcaccefa4f3d2162d55cd118617ca80d8587b3e3d8910f", "type": "statement", "text": "queryKnobs overrides supported internal parameters for matching shapes across the cluster; the per-shape value takes precedence over the instance parameter and compiled default. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Per-shape maxTimeMS and queryKnobs (9.0)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.nosqlbooster.com/blog/announcing-nosqlbooster-11-2/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:3306142c7e1e2c7b3864a59c5f7c4f8445b0faf02260cd878c0038fab886bf41", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:af2ee18b68ce1569b453b4844fb25779999f2ea0972968309117806a1ecc8f28"]}
{"id": "clm:55a5acf2010393b0890141dd9f971e5582345b33951411a0bf2817db55428c49", "type": "statement", "text": "queryKnobs updates merge by knob: omitted knobs remain, an empty document does nothing, and null removes one knob. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Per-shape maxTimeMS and queryKnobs (9.0)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-123662"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:3306142c7e1e2c7b3864a59c5f7c4f8445b0faf02260cd878c0038fab886bf41", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:4f8417f1fa9c1c743e11469b4239009da1e1707357cbef4c0306eb7fc47e4017"]}
{"id": "clm:c66983dca2302164dd78ee4f4f66708a36f17eea4c42284e3697669f488f0695", "type": "statement", "text": "Knob validation rejects unknown or ineligible names, wrong types, invalid enums, out-of-range values, and knobs requiring a newer FCV. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Per-shape maxTimeMS and queryKnobs (9.0)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-128267", "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-121945"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:3306142c7e1e2c7b3864a59c5f7c4f8445b0faf02260cd878c0038fab886bf41", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:af2ee18b68ce1569b453b4844fb25779999f2ea0972968309117806a1ecc8f28"]}
{"id": "clm:35bd77ffc2dbe9757dc507d8050d568eac957b7e33a42007eac3ee9d5de82fbe", "type": "statement", "text": "Knobs participate in hashed query settings and the plan-cache key; changing a knob value produces a fresh key. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Per-shape maxTimeMS and queryKnobs (9.0)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:3306142c7e1e2c7b3864a59c5f7c4f8445b0faf02260cd878c0038fab886bf41", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:af2ee18b68ce1569b453b4844fb25779999f2ea0972968309117806a1ecc8f28"]}
{"id": "clm:296e6582a99a0c589f7750f22d079f314685f9257afe187b12c6c4eea763fc48", "type": "statement", "text": "FCV downgrade removes incompatible knobs; upgrading again does not restore them. Reapply the removed settings explicitly. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Per-shape maxTimeMS and queryKnobs (9.0)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:3306142c7e1e2c7b3864a59c5f7c4f8445b0faf02260cd878c0038fab886bf41", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:af2ee18b68ce1569b453b4844fb25779999f2ea0972968309117806a1ecc8f28"]}
{"id": "clm:86965c0824aaa696c30d4231101636da3121502d2cae4390333dd7b58290ab08", "type": "statement", "text": "The reviewed master-branch QuerySettingsService interface exempts explain execution from the stored maxTimeMS while still reporting it; use an actual execution to test enforcement. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-27)", "source_url": "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/master/src/mongo/db/query/query_settings/query_settings_service.h", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Per-shape maxTimeMS and queryKnobs (9.0)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:3306142c7e1e2c7b3864a59c5f7c4f8445b0faf02260cd878c0038fab886bf41", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:70224cae852f9d36f8148d02b140d6242300888fd82f21ba1038bc399b7bc1c2"]}
